# Open-Astro Licensing Notice

Open-Astro and all related components (including AlpacaHTTP, AlpacaCore,
and AlpacaDrivers) are licensed under the Server Side Public License
(SSPL) Version 1.

This license ensures Open-Astro remains open-source and prevents closed,
proprietary astrophotography platforms from incorporating this software
without open-sourcing their entire stack, including all software required
to deliver the service or device functionality.

The full text of the SSPL v1 license is published by MongoDB and available at:
https://www.mongodb.com/legal/licensing/server-side-public-license

This repository’s LICENSE file serves as a reference to the canonical license text.
